{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10038","headline":"览史 · 张良璞","name":"览史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"享年八十已，历数穷苍生。\n七虎门源上，咆哮关内鸣。\n建都用鹑宿，设险因金城。\n舜曲烟火起，汾河珠翠明。\n海云引天仗，朔雪留边兵。\n作孽人怨久，其亡鬼信盈。\n素灵感刘季，白马从子婴。\n昏虐不务德，百代无芳声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张良璞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}